 "metadata": {
  "note": "Verbatim DDInter 2.0 slice for issue #339 review round 1 \u2014 a CLASS-ONLY chip and a RULE chip naming ONE prescription. Rows are field-for-field their shipped-KB rows in KB order, and the interaction rows are every KB pair among these drugs. Methylprednisolone is filed as two rows of one substance (one drugbank_id, one rxnorm_name) publishing the same ATC list, of which DrugReference.canonicalRow elects the unqualified one while a chart recording the topical presentation elects the other \u2014 the issue #187 shape, on the PARTNER slot. Prednisolone shares H02AB with it and their only KB rule is rated Unknown, which the shipped chartsearchai.drugSafety.minInteractionSeverity default filters, so that pair reaches the class arm alone; Warfarin shares no subgroup and its Moderate rule clears the floor, so that pair reaches the rule arm alone. One question naming both therefore produces one chip of each kind about one active order."
 },
